From: Plain Browser
Subject: [ui] Strings of the protections UI as a grdp part of generated_resources.grd, with Polish translations

Category: 60-ui. The strings of //plainbrowser/shields (toolbar button, bubble, the exception list in
Settings) live with their code in src/plainbrowser/shields/resources: one .grdp and one .xtb per translated
language. This patch only lists them in chrome/app/generated_resources.grd (a <part> and a <file> in
<translations>; grit merges several xtb files of one language) and in its .gritdeps, which grit_info
compares with the grd's real inputs at build time. The IDS_ ids land in chrome/grit/generated_resources.h,
and the locale .pak files carry the strings without any change to the repack rules. Every message has a
"meaning" attribute, so its translation id cannot collide with a Chromium message of the same English text.
---
--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
@@ -249,6 +249,8 @@
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_or.xtb" lang="or" />
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_pa.xtb" lang="pa" />
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_pl.xtb" lang="pl" />
+    <!-- Plain Browser: translations of plainbrowser_shields_strings.grdp. -->
+    <file path="../../plainbrowser/shields/resources/plainbrowser_shields_strings_pl.xtb" lang="pl" />
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_pt-BR.xtb" lang="pt-BR" />
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_pt-PT.xtb" lang="pt-PT" />
     <file path="resources/generated_resources_ro.xtb" lang="ro" />
@@ -309,6 +311,11 @@
 
       <!-- Shortcut Input specific strings -->
       <part file="shortcut_input_strings.grdp" />
+
+      <!-- Plain Browser: toolbar button, bubble and settings section of the
+           protections (//plainbrowser/shields). Outside this directory on
+           purpose: the strings live with their code. -->
+      <part file="../../plainbrowser/shields/resources/plainbrowser_shields_strings.grdp" />
 
       <!-- Chrome-OS-specific strings -->
       <if expr="is_chromeos">
--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
@@ -108,3 +108,5 @@
 chrome/app/support_tool_strings.grdp
 chrome/app/vr_strings.grdp
 chrome/app/whats_new_strings.grdp
+plainbrowser/shields/resources/plainbrowser_shields_strings.grdp
+plainbrowser/shields/resources/plainbrowser_shields_strings_pl.xtb
